dynasty (202 BC-9 AD)"}],"shuowen":"《說文》：“鑄，銷金也。从金，壽聲。”","comments":[{"source":"academia-sinica","text":"吳大澂古籀補：“古鑄字象手鑄器形，下象鑪火，中：為金，以火銷金曰鑄。”李孝定《甲骨文字集釋》按：“金文鑄字多見，均為會意字。或又增壽為聲符，或又增金為形符，省之則為篆文形聲字之鑄矣。上从兩手持倒皿，中貯銷金之液，兩手持而傾之範中也。下从皿則範也。中从火，象所銷之金，或从丫，亦象金液。”"}],"variants":[{"char":"鑄","parts":"金壽","source":"academia-sinica"},{"char":"𨥇","parts":"金寸","source":"academia-sinica"},{"char":"鍺","parts":"金者","source":"academia-sinica"}]},"𨥮":{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873dea4","char":"𨥮","codepoint":"U+2896E","strokeCount":13,"sources":["unicode"]},"𨦌":{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873dec2","char":"𨦌","codepoint":"U+2898C","strokeCount":14,"sources":["unicode"]},"𨦙":{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873decf","char":"𨦙","codepoint":"U+28999","strokeCount":14,"sources":["unicode"]},"𨦞":{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873ded4","char":"𨦞","codepoint":"U+2899E","strokeCount":14,"sources":["unicode"]},"𨦫":{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873dee1","char":"𨦫","codepoint":"U+289AB","strokeCount":14,"simpVariants":["䦀"],"sources":["unicode"]},"𨦮":{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873dee4","char":"𨦮","codepoint":"U+289AE","strokeCount":15,"sources":["unicode"]},"𨦰":{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873dee6","char":"𨦰","codepoint":"U+289B0","strokeCount":15,"sources":["unicode"]},"𨧎":{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873df04","char":"𨧎","codepoint":"U+289CE","strokeCount":15,"sources":["academia-sinica","unicode"],"images":[{"url":"https://data.dong-chinese.com/img/sinica/%F0%A8%A7%8E_0.png","source":"academia-sinica","description":"說文‧金部","type":"Seal","era":"Shuowen (~100 AD)"}],"shuowen":"《說文》：“銎，斤釜穿也。从金，巩聲。”","comments":[{"source":"academia-sinica","text":"段玉裁注改“釜”作“斧”。"}],"variants":[{"char":"銎","parts":"巩金","source":"academia-sinica"}]},"𨧖":{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873df0c","char":"𨧖","codepoint":"U+289D6","strokeCount":15,"sources":["unicode"]},"𨧱":{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873df27","char":"𨧱","codepoint":"U+289F1","strokeCount":16,"simpVariants":["𨱊"],"sources":["unicode"]},"𨧳":{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873df29","char":"𨧳","codepoint":"U+289F3",